  "the gate's out-of-sample window is FIXED at 2024-01-01: an earlier anchor adds in-sample warm-up, not OOS evidence -- what moves with the anchor is the path that reaches the same 2024+ bars",
  "membership is today's: the bond-free universe and the volatility classes are derived from the whole panel, so a 2015 anchor is today's names priced backwards, not the 2015 ETF menu",
  "K1 is a reading of today's tape and is identical at every anchor by construction; only S1 and A1 can move with the anchor",
  "yearly returns are read off the same level curve and summed, not compounded; the last year is partial and is not annualised into the era table",
  "the era step is a description of resolution, never an admission rule: the admission lines remain candidate_year_gate's and the faces keep their verdicts",
  "the verdict words and the aggregate are the phase face's / year gate's own functions; this face adds no threshold"
